WEBVTT

00:28.866 --> 00:34.489
Remind me The clock is ticking on the classroom

00:34.509 --> 00:41.352
wall But time stands still here in the hall I saw

00:41.392 --> 00:44.854
your face and the world went black

00:47.895 --> 00:54.780
The sweetest song that I ever heard No need to run

00:55.041 --> 01:01.146
and no need to hide I'm pulling up a chair right by

01:01.186 --> 01:02.708
your side

01:06.672 --> 01:09.675
They say the lightning strikes and then it's

01:09.715 --> 01:17.062
gone But with a blow before the dawn Yeah with a

01:17.122 --> 01:22.768
light that's moving on It only takes three

01:22.808 --> 01:28.352
minutes to believe In the magic that we're

01:28.392 --> 01:33.897
starting to weave It's a heart to heart, it's a

01:33.957 --> 01:37.900
brand new start Tearing the shadows of the night

01:37.920 --> 01:44.318
apart Can you hear it? I can hear it! Can you feel

01:44.338 --> 01:49.704
it? I can feel it! Second to forever!

02:17.007 --> 02:19.389
Sake-chan forever!

